+            // The builders explicitly stripped these as "thin, won't block" — in play the
+            // player ghosts through banner poles, lantern posts and stall posts (report #2).
+            // All of them are Unity primitive cylinders (local mesh: height 2, radius 0.5),
+            // so a default-fit CapsuleCollider matches exactly under any transform scale.
+            int poles = 0;
